WEBVTT

00:23:29.690 --> 00:23:31.171
I was like, "Wow, that's crazy.

00:23:31.195 --> 00:23:33.549
I was working on a novel
about the Amazon jungle."

00:23:33.573 --> 00:23:34.885
Already that's pretty cool.

00:23:34.909 --> 00:23:37.344
Then we sat down.
I said, "What's your novel about?"

00:23:37.368 --> 00:23:39.515
She was about 100 pages
into it at that point.

00:23:39.539 --> 00:23:42.109
And she said, "It's about
a spinster from Minnesota

00:23:42.133 --> 00:23:45.122
who is working in
a big multinational corporation,

00:23:45.146 --> 00:23:47.159
who is in love with her married boss

00:23:47.183 --> 00:23:51.122
and who gets involved in this really
chaotic program down in the Amazon,

00:23:51.146 --> 00:23:53.324
a bunch of money
and a person goes missing,

00:23:53.348 --> 00:23:55.022
and she gets sent down there,

00:23:55.046 --> 00:23:57.977
and her life is uprooted
as she goes into this jungle

00:23:58.001 --> 00:23:59.524
in order to solve this mystery.

00:23:59.548 --> 00:24:01.545
It was exactly the same story.